---Data representing a Team.
---@class vercel.teams.Team
---@field apiKeysInvalidatedAt? number Timestamp (ms) after which API keys created at or before this time are considered invalid for this team.
---@field appTokensInvalidatedAt? number Timestamp (ms) after which Vercel App tokens created at or before this time are considered invalid for this team.
