---@field billing vercel.teams.TeamBilling|distilled.Null The team's billing plan.
---@field connect? vercel.teams.TeamConnect
---@field createdAt number UNIX timestamp (in milliseconds) when the Team was created.
---@field creatorId string The ID of the user who created the Team.
---@field defaultContinuousUsageKind? vercel.teams.TeamDefaultContinuousUsageKind Default continuous-usage billing kind for projects under this team. Absent means projects stay unmetered.
---@field defaultDeploymentProtection vercel.teams.TeamDefaultDeploymentProtection Deployment protection defaults for new projects in this team. When no Vercel Authentication default is saved, `ssoProtection` shows Standard Protection. An explicitly saved `null` remains disabled. Organization policy may override the team default during project creation.
---@field defaultExpirationSettings? vercel.teams.TeamDefaultExpirationSettings Default deployment expiration settings for this team
---@field defaultPassport? vercel.teams.TeamDefaultPassport|distilled.Null Default Passport configuration for new projects in this team.
---@field defaultProjectJobs? vercel.teams.TeamDefaultProjectJobs Default job configuration applied to new projects created in this team.
---@field defaultRoles? vercel.teams.TeamDefaultRoles Default roles for the team.
---@field deploymentPolicy? vercel.teams.TeamDeploymentPolicy Composable deployment-time policy for the team. Used as the default for every project on the team, with optional per-project overrides on `project.deploymentPolicy`.
---@field deploymentStorageRollout? vercel.teams.TeamDeploymentStorageRollout Pro deployment-storage pricing rollout cohort and milestones. Absent when the team has not been placed in a rollout cohort yet.
---@field description string|distilled.Null A short description of the Team.
---@field disableHardAutoBlocks? vercel.teams.TeamDisableHardAutoBlocks
---@field disableRepositoryDispatchEvents? boolean Default for projects in the team. When `true`, projects in this team will not emit GitHub repository-dispatch events on deployment events unless the project explicitly overrides this setting via `project.gitProviderOptions.disableRepositoryDispatchEvents`.
---@field disjunctiveProductionSecretPolicy? vercel.teams.TeamDisjunctiveProductionSecretPolicy|distilled.Null Require production secrets to use a different value than preview or development.
---@field dpAccessRequestsMode? vercel.teams.TeamDpAccessRequestsMode Controls who can request access to protected deployments.
---@field emailDomain? string|distilled.Null Hostname that'll be matched with emails on sign-up to automatically join the Team.
