---@field hideIpAddressesInLogDrains? boolean|distilled.Null Indicates if IP addresses should be accessible in log drains
---@field id string The Team's unique identifier.
---@field integrationTokensInvalidatedAt? number Timestamp (ms) after which integration tokens created at or before this time are considered invalid for this team.
---@field inviteCode? string Code that can be used to join this Team. Only visible to Team owners.
---@field ipBuckets? vercel.teams.TeamIpBucketsList
